[{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Is this... er... er... room number 26?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/4.mp3"},{"answer":"So, is this the Student Job Centre?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/5.mp3"},{"answer":"It certainly is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/6.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, actually I'm looking for a job - a part-time job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have anything available at the moment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, yes... Are you a registered student?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid this service is only available to full-time students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes... I am.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm doing a degree in Business Studies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Here's my student card.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Which year are you in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... I've been at uni for four years but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm in the third year because I took last year off.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Right... well...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/18.mp3"},{"answer":"let's just have a look at what positions are available at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/19.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a job working at the reception desk at the Sports Centre, for three evenings a week -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/20.mp3"},{"answer":"that's Wednesdays, Thursdays and Fridays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/21.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds like fun but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/22.mp3"},{"answer":"unfortunately I have evening lectures - so that's not possible, I'm afraid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything during the day?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/24.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, that's no good then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Um... What about cleaning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/26.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a position for a cleaner at the Child Care Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/27.mp3"},{"answer":"But you'd need to be there at 6 am.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Does that appeal?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Six o'clock in the morning!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's far too early for me, I'm afraid...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd never make it that early in the morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there was a position going in the Computer Lab for three days a week that might be okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, here it is!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/34.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it's in the library, not the lab,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... Clerical Assistant required -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it mostly involves putting the books back on the shelves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh no, hang on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It's for Wednesday and Friday evenings again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/39.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I can't manage that because of the lectures.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/40.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I'm getting the idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... look, I'll just get a few details from you anyway,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and then we can check through the list and see what comes up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/43.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll fill in the personal details on this application form first, if that's okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what's your name again?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Anita Newman -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/47.mp3"},{"answer":"that's NEWMAN.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And your address, Anita?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm in one of the Halls of Residence for post-graduate students,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/50.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, International House.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, that's easy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Er... what's your room number there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Room B569.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Er... No, sorry, B659.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I always get that wrong. I haven't been living there very long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any other skills?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Typing, languages, that sort of thing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I speak some Japanese.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I'll make a note of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, let's see what else is available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/61.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think of administrative work?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/62.mp3"},{"answer":"There is a position for an Office Assistant at the English Language Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/63.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/64.mp3"},{"answer":"It's for 3 days a week -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Monday, Friday and Saturday mornings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Interested?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm... I was hoping to have Saturdays free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/68.mp3"},{"answer":"But I need the work so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/69.mp3"},{"answer":"can you tell me what the job involves?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Yup, sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/71.mp3"},{"answer":"It says here that you'll be required to deal with student enquiries and answer the phone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'm sure I can handle all that without a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, would you like me to arrange an interview for you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Say, Friday morning, around ten?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... Ah... Could we make it a bit later?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Unfortunately, I've got something to do at ten.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Would that be okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Not a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/80.mp3"},{"answer":"How about eleven thirty?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Hope it works out for you Anita.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too. And thanks for all your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-3-part-1-2023-07-30-23-02-46/83.mp3"}]
